// Tree shapes. Kinds 0–2 are the original oak / birch / spruce; the rest are new.
// 3 big oak, 4 dark oak (2×2 trunk), 5 cherry, 6 tall spruce, 7 swamp oak. Canopies stay within 5 blocks of the trunk.
